      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There are no words for how spectacular an event this is.\n\nGod Bless America and every single person who made this mission happen. \ud83d\ude80 \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\n\nNASA (@NASA)\n\nWelcome home Reid, Victor, Christina, and Jeremy! \ud83e\udef6\n\nThe Artemis II astronauts have splashed down at 8:07pm ET (0007 UTC April 11), bringing their historic 10-day mission around the Moon to an end.\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/NASA/status/2042756933686337713#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2042800879263252957",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-11T03:04:17+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "And truly if there\u2019s one journalist people should pay attention to to get the tenor and tone of the American voter, it is you Salena.\n\n\nZitoSalena (@ZitoSalena)\n\nI kept saying that his popularity and more importantly influence was way overblown by people on this website. \n\nAsked people I interview all the time and the answer was always the same they were a long time gone from Tucker.\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/ZitoSalena/status/2042700115010273659#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2042700890067325148",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T20:26:58+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I don't know how every single podcaster and influencer hasn't realized by this time that republicans will choose Trump over them - absolutely every single time.\n\n\nOverton (@overton_news)\n\n\ud83d\udea8 CNN just admitted that President Trump is CRUSHING Tucker Carlson in net favorability among Republicans.\n\n\u201cThey choose Donald Trump basically EVERY SINGLE TIME.\u201d\n\nTheir polling breakdown showed Republican voters are siding with Trump by an overwhelming margin.\n\nCNN: \u201cLook at this! \u2014 This UMass Lowell poll, lo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2042639626427375790",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T16:23:32+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Hilarious.\n\n\nAaron Blake (@AaronBlake)\n\nTucker Carlson isn't that popular among Republican-leaners anymore, according to a new UMass-Lowell/YouGov poll:\n\n31% favorable\n24% unfavorable\n\nAnd he's 2-to-1 negative overall.\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/AaronBlake/status/2042576817685405810#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2042606759034925242",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-10T14:12:55+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "meghan-mccain",
      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Excellent column by \u2066@mirandadevine\u2069:  nypost.com/2026/04/08/opinio\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/MeghanMcCain/status/2042198362863092008",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-09T11:10:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
